        <news>v1.0.14 add Marissa's Watch List (top-level)
v1.0.13 more pins by age (toddler/boy/girl/family), organized into categories
v1.0.12 Pokémon pins + dedicated top-level Pinned menu
v1.0.11 pinned searches (Zelda/Mario/Minecraft) in Search
v1.0.10 Surprise Sport now only picks a sport with a game live right now
v1.0.9 new logo (CEO of Chill 🐶🕶️)
v1.0.8 fix Status screen title
v1.0.7 trivia (Q then answer) + simplified Tools page
v1.0.6 home screen now shows random Pokémon/Kirby/Minecraft facts
v1.0.5 streamline Setup (fewer confirmation dialogs)
v1.0.4 Surprise Me buttons + fix Live TV/Kids channels (use get_list, no search prompt)
v1.0.3 rename to Jake's Config Hub + color/emoji flair + welcome splash
v1.0.2 US-first sports reorder + Live TV + Kids sections
v1.0.1 trim debrid options to AllDebrid + TorBox
v1.0.0 initial release</news>
